B.b1u=new A.ks("Sincerity \u2014 Cleaning the Why","Actions are only by intentions (Bukhari 1). The same prayer can be worship or theater depending on the why. The Prophet \ufdfa called the first three generations the best because their deeds were built on ikhlas \u2014 and he warned that one day people would act for other than Allah\u2019s face.",u.h1)
B.b1s=new A.ks("Patience \u2014 The Standing Muscle","Allah is with the patient (2:153). Patience is not the absence of pain; it is the presence of staying. Ya\u2019qub said 'I only complain of my suffering to Allah' (12:86) \u2014 grief and patience in the same sentence, and the Qur'an called his patience beautiful.",u.aS)
B.b1w=new A.ks("Gratitude \u2014 The Increase Clause","If you are grateful, I will surely increase you (14:7). Gratitude is not a mood \u2014 it is a contract with increase written into it. The Prophet \ufdfa called the one who eats and praises Allah like one who fasts patiently and praises.","Name three things before sleep tonight that you never earned and could never count.")
B.b1A=new A.ks(u.fb,"Truthfulness leads to righteousness, and righteousness leads to Paradise (Bukhari 6094). And a man keeps speaking truth until Allah records him as truthful \u2014 the trait becomes the title. Lies, the hadith warns, lead the other direction.",u.aC)
B.aAv=s([B.b1u,B.b1s,B.b1w,B.b1A],t.Ke)
B.b1F=new A.Gm("The Weight You Carry","Akhlaq is not decoration \u2014 it is the load-bearing structure of a life. These are the traits that hold everything else up.",B.aAv)
B.b1v=new A.ks("Anger \u2014 The Ember","The strong is not the wrestler; the strong is the one who controls himself at anger (Bukhari 6114). The Prophet \ufdfa prescribed the physical cures: change posture, seek refuge from Shaytan, and if standing, sit; if sitting, lie down. Anger is cooled by the body before the mind.","Next time the heat rises: sit down if standing, say a\u2019udhu billah, and wait ninety seconds.")
B.b1C=new A.ks("Envy \u2014 The Second Look","Envy eats good deeds like fire eats wood (Abu Dawud 4253). The cure the Prophet \ufdfa taught is not pretending the blessing isn\u2019t real \u2014 it is praying for the one who has it: 'O Allah, bless them in it.' The prayer converts the poison.",u.X)
B.b1B=new A.ks("Arrogance \u2014 The False Height","No one with an atom\u2019s weight of arrogance enters Paradise (Muslim 91). The Prophet \ufdfa defined it as refusing truth and despising people. Musa was called to speak despite his stutter; the Messenger \ufdfa wept for his people. Greatness in this deen bends low.",u.bd)
B.b1x=new A.ks("Despair \u2014 The Closed Door","Say: O My servants who have transgressed against themselves, do not despair of the mercy of Allah. Indeed, Allah forgives all sins (39:53). The devil\u2019s greatest lie is not that sin is small \u2014 it is that mercy is smaller.",u.g9)
B.afH=s([B.b1v,B.b1C,B.b1B,B.b1x],t.Ke)
B.b1E=new A.Gm("The Heart\u2019s Enemies","Four viruses the Prophet \ufdfa named by name \u2014 and their cures.",B.afH)
B.b1z=new A.ks("The Tongue \u2014 Your Daily Ledger","Whoever believes in Allah and the Last Day should speak good or remain silent (Bukhari 6018). And whoever guarantees me what is between his jaws and his legs, I guarantee Paradise. A whole day can be built on that one guarantee.","Run today\u2019s speech through one filter: would I say it with the person standing here?")
B.b1t=new A.ks("Forgiveness \u2014 Releasing the Debtor","The Prophet \ufdfa was asked to curse the people of Taif and he prayed for their children instead. Allah described the servants of the Merciful as those who pardon people (3:134) \u2014 and the reward for pardoning is measured by Allah, who loves to pardon.",u.eK)
B.b1D=new A.ks("Kindness \u2014 The Missing Dates","Aisha was asked what the Prophet \ufdfa did at home. She said: he was in the service of his family (Bukhari 676). The strongest man in the room served. Kindness is not weakness; in his house it was leadership.",u.gx)
B.b1y=new A.ks("Brotherhood \u2014 The Whole Body","The believers are like one body \u2014 if the eye aches the whole body aches (Bukhari 6011). And the Muslim is the brother of the Muslim: he does not wrong him, forsake him, or despise him. The ummah is not a membership; it is a shared nervous system.",u.eY)
B.ape=s([B.b1z,B.b1t,B.b1D,B.b1y],t.Ke)
B.b1G=new A.Gm("The Social Heart","Character becomes akhlaq only when other people are involved.",B.ape)
B.anP=s([B.b1F,B.b1E,B.b1G],A.ac("y<Gm>"))
B.anQ=s(["Hadi studies the board the way he studies a hadith \u2014 patiently.","Hadi: Every opening is a doorway. Choose yours well.","Hadi: The middle game rewards the patient heart.","Hadi: A sacrifice given for position is sadaqah on the board.","Hadi: I would rather lose beautifully than win without principle.","Hadi: Your move carries intention \u2014 make it a good one.","Hadi: Even the queen bows to the plan, not the power."],t.s)
