B.bjB=new A.fX("Khadijah \u2014 The First Believer","The first person to believe was a woman \u2014 a merchant of Quraysh who married the trustworthy orphan and financed the mission when no one else would. When the Prophet \ufdfa came down from Hira trembling, she wrapped him and said: Allah will never disgrace you.",u.gJ)
B.bjH=new A.fX("Asiya \u2014 The Palace of Pharaoh","She lived in the house of the tyrant and was heartbroken in it \u2014 and Allah showed her her house in Paradise (66:11). Sometimes the palace is the test, not the prize.",u.a)
B.bjG=new A.fX("Maryam \u2014 The Palm Tree","Alone, in labor, accused \u2014 and the angels spoke to her (19:16-33). Allah named an entire surah after a woman; her name appears more times in the Qur'an than in the entire Bible. Solitude with Allah is never abandonment.",u.e8)
B.bjP=new A.fX("Hagar \u2014 She Ran Seven Times","Alone in a barren valley with a crying child \u2014 and 'He will not waste us' became the walk between Safa and Marwah that every pilgrim still walks (2:158). Her tawakkul built a rite.",u.gm)
B.akc=s([B.bjB,B.bjH,B.bjG,B.bjP],t.AE)
B.bjW=new A.Bp("Iman That Built","The first believers, the first martyrs, the first to build the ummah were women.",B.akc)
B.bjF=new A.fX("Aisha \u2014 The Scholar of Scholars","The companions asked her about inheritance, medicine, poetry, and the Prophet\u2019s household. Her student Urwa said he had never seen anyone more knowledgeable in fiqh, medicine, or poetry. She taught with her door open and her mind sharper.",u.R)
B.bjC=new A.fX("Fatima \u2014 The Brightest House","The Prophet \ufdfa called her the leader of the women of Paradise \u2014 and she still ground barley until her hands bled and asked for a servant (Bukhari 3423). The highest rank and the grinding stone lived in the same hands.",u.g7)
B.bjD=new A.fX("Hafsa \u2014 The Keeper of the Book","After the Prophet\u2019s passing, the first written Qur'an was kept with Hafsa \u2014 the ummah\u2019s first librarian was a widow. Uthman\u2019s standard copies were made from her sheets.",u.d)
B.bjz=new A.fX("Umm Ayman \u2014 The One They Forgot to List","She raised the Prophet \ufdfa after his parents died \u2014 and he called her 'my mother after my mother.' The barakah of a household often lives with the person no one thinks to mention.",u.H)
B.azc=s([B.bjF,B.bjC,B.bjD,B.bjz],t.AE)
B.bjT=new A.Bp("Scholarship That Taught","The ummah\u2019s first scholars were the women of the Prophet\u2019s house \u2014 and the chain never broke.",B.azc)
B.bjE=new A.fX("Sumayyah \u2014 The First to Give Everything","The first martyr of Islam was a slave woman. Abu Jahl\u2019s spear could not make her curse the Prophet \u2014 so she became the ummah\u2019s first lesson in standing.",u.aG)
B.bjR=new A.fX("Nusaybah bint Ka'b \u2014 Umm Ammarah","At Uhud, when the line broke and men fled, she stood between the Prophet \ufdfa and the swords \u2014 shielding him with her body until she was cut. The Prophet \ufdfa said: wherever I turned, she was there.",u.cX)
B.bjA=new A.fX("Khawlah \u2014 Whose Question Changed the Law","She stood before the caliph Umar and argued her case with the Qur'an until the law was corrected (58:1 is her verse). Standing before authority with the Book in hand is a woman\u2019s right and a believer\u2019s duty.",u.aM)
B.bjL=new A.fX("Asma \u2014 She Who Carried the Food","During the Prophet\u2019s Hijrah, she tied the food and water to her waist and climbed the mountain \u2014 and the Qur'an remembered her (9:40). Sometimes the logistics of a revolution are carried on one woman\u2019s belt.","What are you carrying for someone else\u2019s journey? Keep carrying it.")
B.bjM=new A.fX(u.ek,"She said the dua of the afflicted \u2014 'to Allah we belong and to Him we return' \u2014 and her heartache became revelation (2:156). Her later question about 'the men only' brought the verse that included the women (33:35).",u.I)
B.ap8=s([B.bjE,B.bjR,B.bjA,B.bjL,B.bjM],t.AE)
B.bjV=new A.Bp("Standing That Changed History","When the line broke, the women held it.",B.ap8)
B.bjJ=new A.fX("Khadijah \u2014 The First Believer","The first person to believe was a woman \u2014 a merchant who financed the mission when no one else would. When the Prophet \ufdfa came down from Hira trembling, she wrapped him and said: Allah will never disgrace you.",u.gJ)
B.bjI=new A.fX("Aisha \u2014 The Scholar of Scholars","The companions asked her about inheritance, medicine, poetry, and the Prophet\u2019s household. Her student Urwa said he had never seen anyone more knowledgeable in fiqh, medicine, or poetry.",u.R)
B.bjK=new A.fX("Zaynab \u2014 Generosity That Hurt","She gave so much to the poor that the Prophet \ufdfa told her to keep something for herself \u2014 and she answered that what she gave, Allah would replace. The wife who out-gave the household.",u.dk)
B.bjQ=new A.fX(u.g,"Taken in battle, she asked the Prophet \ufdfa for her freedom; he offered more \u2014 marriage. Her mahr freed her whole clan. The captivity narrative ended in a wedding that freed a hundred families.","Who in your life is a captive of circumstance \u2014 and what could you free them from this month?")
B.bjO=new A.fX("Hafsa \u2014 The Keeper of the Book","After the Prophet\u2019s passing, the first written Qur\u2019an was kept with Hafsa \u2014 the ummah\u2019s first librarian was a widow.",u.d)
B.bjN=new A.fX("Safiyya \u2014 The Woman Who Answered","Mocked for her Jewish ancestry, she answered the Prophet\u2019s question with the truth: 'Aaron is my father, Moses my uncle, and Muhammad my husband.' The answer that silenced the mockers.",u.bI)
B.bjS=new A.fX("Bilqis \u2014 The Queen Who Knew a Letter","She ruled a kingdom, and a letter from Sulayman rearranged her throne. She kept her crown and found her Lord \u2014 the only woman in the Qur\u2019an whose submission is recorded in her own words.","What letter has reached you recently that deserves an answer like Bilqis\u2019s?")
B.aiK=s([B.bjJ,B.bjI,B.bjK,B.bjQ,B.bjO,B.bjN,B.bjS],t.AE)
B.bjU=new A.Bp("The Wives \u2014 The Mothers of the Believers","The Prophet\u2019s wives were not a footnote; they were the teachers of a generation.",B.aiK)
B.atf=s([B.bjW,B.bjT,B.bjV,B.bjU],A.ac("y<Bp>"))
